2
00:01.500 --> 00:07.466
In darkness, a light switch on a wood-paneled wall. A pale hand reaches in and flips it on.

3
00:07.466 --> 00:14.223
Lights on. The camera pans across a cluttered room of shelves packed with books and supplies. Two figures stand among them: a nude female mannequin with a curly blonde wig, one hand on her hip, and a figure in a puffy white suit.

4
00:14.223 --> 00:21.855
Close-ups. The figure in white wears a fake black beard, dark sunglasses, and a red-and-gold turban. The mannequin's wig falls across one eye.

5
00:21.855 --> 00:33.408
Book spines fill the frame; one reads "NABOKOV." The mannequin's face in profile, then the room again.

6
00:33.408 --> 00:37.496
Pink string lights blur in the foreground. The man in the white suit stands beside a refrigerator, his hand on the door.

7
00:37.496 --> 00:44.628
On a bookshelf, a sign reads "SMILE YOU'RE ON CAMERA," beside books including "GRAY'S ANATOMY."

8
00:44.628 --> 00:55.389
From inside the refrigerator: the man opens the door and reaches in, moving items on the shelves.

9
00:55.389 --> 01:03.730
The mannequin turns. Close-up: the man's hand strums an acoustic guitar. The camera tilts up to his face in profile.

10
01:03.730 --> 01:13.657
Alternating views: the mannequin's face; a cluttered desk with a paper cut-out face; the man seated with the guitar; the mannequin standing before the shelves. A sign reads "Please Keep Quiet In the Library."

11
01:13.657 --> 01:24.918
Extreme close-up: the mannequin's eyes look upward. Hands play the guitar, fingers pressing the frets, the other hand strumming.

12
01:24.918 --> 01:43.061
Close-ups alternate between the two faces, then return to the guitar: the strumming hand, and fingers moving along the neck.

13
01:43.061 --> 01:51.778
The man's face in close-up, his mouth slightly open behind the fake beard. The mannequin's glossy lips and eyes fill the frame.

14
01:51.778 --> 02:03.019
